Package: nbzinbHossen
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
    via IRLS
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Arman", "Hossen", , "hossena@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively
    reweighted least squares alternated with Newton-Raphson updates of the
    dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial regression
    by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits. Written for the STA
    651 final project.
